{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_title", "source_sha256": "fda01f51d4f8f0f73cd125dc2f6c879a2e3673a33de5768fd665171b574d9e24", "ja": "百合子とおでかけ2", "zh": "和百合子外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4d050949369b5490e5d2056b55826c733c9872780ef54a05925347436a03bb97", "ja": "百合子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与百合子外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5882830f91ec0a3023ac4f092df78abac491fbe2beb33541d4c22f2d87cec78f", "ja": "（ツアー中のオフ。百合子がどうしても行きたいと\n言うので、天文台にやってきた）", "zh": "（巡演期间的休息时间。百合子无论如何都想去，所以我们来到了天文台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6f496d18fccecfa7e615191305e6e47e269b886584d023ac1a40f4164e644f8", "ja": "今日こそ、この目に焼き付けていかないと……。\n必ず……。", "zh": "今天一定要把它深深印在眼里才行……  \n一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d513c915cba74602e600868bd8bd8d2bffdf1885c58768e2af9ce934a78df680", "ja": "百合子、すごい気合いの入れようだな……。\nそんなに星が見たかったのか？", "zh": "百合子，你还真是干劲十足啊……\n就那么想看星星吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "e99393f878f1eb1d65716d955af38191f7e1e10aebc125675f1161ccb76498e2", "ja": "星もなんですけど、私が本当に見たいのは、\nもっとすごいものです！", "zh": "星星确实很棒，不过我真正想看的，是更加不得了的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "66cc3c437b460c8e00df58bb051ab81c1c24e00042b57edd4c3cf86fa79e1b1e", "ja": "星より、もっとすごいもの……？", "zh": "比星星还要厉害的东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "d1d691ebbebee5715e087a8e0137fd5b48cb6f1d2ae8936981d0b16111aacc29", "ja": "フッフッフ……。{$P$}さん、\nよくぞ聞いてくれました！", "zh": "呵呵呵……{$P$}先生，\n你问得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "3ad577a6216d16c78471ebc64498ff2a45ebdd2483d78013343a603b381630b8", "ja": "実は最近、この辺りで\nよく目撃されているんですよ……あれが！", "zh": "其实最近在这附近，\n经常有人目击到哦……那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b7ec595bfb388752a2fa24fec078a5d390173d63619dfe66123fb3479831036b", "ja": "あれ？　あ、なんか予想がついてきたな……。", "zh": "咦？啊，我好像已经猜到是什么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "4a676fca791844818e718e210406f84136cae3743c0b6278c9c20907a0cb03f5", "ja": "はい、未確認飛行物体です！\n私、まだ本物を見たことがなくて！", "zh": "是的，就是未确认飞行物体！\n我还没见过真的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "a7303f6a2517f33655f32ed68fb0de88eb761a44de02691cafd4225f00b584fc", "ja": "来たれ、アダムスキー型！　あ、手をつないで\nくるくるまわりましょう！　出現率がアップしますよ！", "zh": "阿达姆斯基型，出现吧！啊，手牵手\n转起圈来吧！这样出现率会提高哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cf660a3a7f1e9fa757b0505a5feabe3a20cef8f6c8f88458332020d2784f8643", "ja": "（これは長丁場になりそうだ……。でも楽しそうだし、\n百合子が納得するまでは付き合おうか。うん……）", "zh": "（看来会是一场持久战啊……不过看起来挺有意思的，在百合子满意之前就陪她一起吧。嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
